# SportsGameOdds (https://sportsgameodds.com) — free tier. Primary provider
# for the player props sidebar and best-leans board. Leave all keys unset to
# hide the sidebar (it fails closed, never blocks the rest of the page).
SPORTSGAMEODDS_API_KEY=
# Optional rotation keys. The pool re-reads env on every request, so adding a
# key here (or via `wrangler secret put`) is picked up on the next request
# without a code deploy.
#   - Comma-separated all keys (primary first):
SPORTSGAMEODDS_API_KEYS=
#   - Individual secondaries, each as its own secret:
SPORTSGAMEODDS_API_KEY_2=
SPORTSGAMEODDS_API_KEY_3=
SPORTSGAMEODDS_API_KEY_4=
SPORTSGAMEODDS_API_KEY_5=

# The Odds API (https://the-odds-api.com) — fallback provider, used only when
# SportsGameOdds errors or has no lines for a game. Same rotation vars.
ODDS_API_KEY=
ODDS_API_KEYS=
ODDS_API_KEY_2=
ODDS_API_KEY_3=
ODDS_API_KEY_4=
ODDS_API_KEY_5=
